":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-04-15T13:33:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T13:56:53Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.6.stable.official [89cea1439] v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7] v4.5.dev2.official [af2c713] v4.5.dev3.official [28089c40c] v4.5.beta5.official [c81fd6c51]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev2\n\n### Issue description\n\nTo give the window focus on creation, I use get_window().grab_focus(), and in the settings, the window is set to open centered. However, I noticed that because of this, the window can appear in the top-left, top-right, or bottom-left corner.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe simplest setup is to just enable window centering and call get_window().grab_focus() in the _ready function. But I don't understand why this behavior happens. It's probably not related to X11 or the editor itself.\n\nI also observed that it happens in exported Linux and Windows builds. For some reason, in an empty project, the window clearly appears in the top-left corner first, then moves to the center, and sometimes it seems to get stuck and remains in the corner. In other projects, it appears centered and then might jump to a corner, but not necessarily the top-left one, even though the settings are the same.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5091b9c-6547-4c1c-8818-b5d1195d353c","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105419/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105419/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}